We practice [Open Science](triple-products) here!

## About Me

I'm an [INTJ-A](https://www.16personalities.com/intj-personality) type of person who cherishes the eclectic, abnormal, atypical aspects of life. I have mastered [Wing Chun](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Qexxe6ANG2o) in High School, [Physical Mathematics](https://www.math.stonybrook.edu/~leontak/) in University, and [Optimization Engineering](https://www.linkedin.com/in/joesuf4/) in my Professional Career.

### Delia Frees, to Me

    Are you familiar with the role the Heyókȟa
    plays in Native American culture? You, my
    dear, are my own personal Heyókȟa.


I created <https://iconoclasts.blog> to cater to kindred-spirits online, who need a censorship-free, long-form essay writing community to share and interact with each other's most politically inconvenient, avant garde ideas.
